WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.682
Whop Checkout adds payment buttons and embedded checkout to the Webflow Designer.

00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:09.365
All app features are free. This narrated walkthrough uses screens captured during

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:13.267
testing of the installed app and its published sandbox demo.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.996
Open Apps in the Webflow Designer, select Whop Checkout, and launch the

00:00:17.996 --> 00:00:22.725
app. The integration is hosted at W F checkout dot Whop Tools

00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:26.667
dot com. Hosted checkout buttons work without connecting the backend.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:31.683
For embedded checkout, choose Connect Webflow. Webflow shows the requested identity, site,

00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:36.700
and custom code permissions. Select only the site you want to connect.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:41.716
No Webflow password or Whop merchant API key is collected by this

00:00:41.716 --> 00:00:42.134
app.

00:00:42.134 --> 00:00:46.940
A user can decline the authorization request. In this test, Cancel returned

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:51.746
a clear cancellation message. The user can start the connection again from

00:00:51.746 --> 00:00:52.547
the app.

00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:57.252
Approving the request returns to the connected page. Go back to the

00:00:57.252 --> 00:01:01.958
Designer and choose Check connection. The backend verifies the Designer identity with

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:05.095
Webflow before allowing changes to the site scripts.

00:01:05.095 --> 00:01:09.982
For a button, choose Checkout button, select Sandbox or Production, and paste

00:01:09.982 --> 00:01:14.868
a matching plan ID or checkout link. Set the button label, select

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:19.755
a container, and add the button. Style the native element using Webflow

00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:20.162
controls.

00:01:20.162 --> 00:01:24.962
For an embedded checkout, select the embedded option and choose the appearance.

00:01:24.962 --> 00:01:29.762
Light, dark, and device themes are available. A return URL is optional.

00:01:29.762 --> 00:01:34.562
Select an existing checkout and use Load selected to edit its settings,

00:01:34.562 --> 00:01:35.762
then Update selected.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:40.857
Enable embedded checkout to register the versioned runtime and add it to

00:01:40.857 --> 00:01:45.951
the site footer. Publish the site to apply this change. The integration

00:01:45.951 --> 00:01:51.046
preserves unrelated site scripts. Its backend manages authorization and installation, not customer

00:01:51.046 --> 00:01:51.895
payment processing.

00:01:51.895 --> 00:01:57.366
This is the published Webflow demo. Whop supplies the price, payment methods,

00:01:57.366 --> 00:02:02.837
and secure payment fields. The app does not receive card details, create

00:02:02.837 --> 00:02:06.028
Webflow Ecommerce orders, or protect Webflow pages.

00:02:06.028 --> 00:02:10.644
A declined sandbox card produced a payment error and left the form

00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:15.259
available for another attempt. This verifies the failure path without making a

00:02:15.259 --> 00:02:16.028
real charge.

00:02:16.028 --> 00:02:20.440
The successful sandbox card completed the payment and reached Whop’s Payment complete

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.851
page. The receipt and any product access are handled by Whop. A

00:02:24.851 --> 00:02:28.895
return URL alone should never be treated as proof of payment.

00:02:28.895 --> 00:02:33.597
The published checkout was also tested at a three hundred and ninety

00:02:33.597 --> 00:02:38.298
pixel mobile width. The form fits the viewport without horizontal overflow. Merchants

00:02:38.298 --> 00:02:41.041
can adjust their surrounding layout in Webflow.

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:45.773
To remove the integration, expand Remove integration and choose Remove scripts and

00:02:45.773 --> 00:02:50.504
disconnect. Publish afterward to remove the runtime from the live site. Delete

00:02:50.504 --> 00:02:54.841
any checkout elements you no longer want, then uninstall the app.

00:02:54.841 --> 00:03:00.140
The removal test returned the app to its disconnected state. Reconnecting and

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:05.439
installing again succeeded. Setup instructions, privacy information, and support are available from

00:03:05.439 --> 00:03:09.855
the app. Separate Webflow and Whop service charges may apply.
